        },
        {
          "step_number": 4,
          "title": "Step 4",
          "instruction": "Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat, cover with a well-fitting lid and gently cook for 1\u00bd hrs, stirring frequently. If too dry, you can add a little more water."
        },
        {
          "step_number": 5,
          "title": "Step 5",
          "instruction": "step 3"
        },
        {
          "step_number": 6,
          "title": "Step 6",
          "instruction": "Add the kabanos to the cabbage mixture, place a lid on the pan and gently simmer for 20 mins. Remove the lid and cook for a further 10 mins. Serve alongside some simple mash or boiled potatoes."
